{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "schinese", "appid": 553850, "month": "2025-02", "window": 4, "start_date": 1740355200, "end_date": 1740787199, "month_true_total": 1378, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:28:15 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "188991856", "author": {"steamid": "76561199186672117", "personaname": "downt", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199186672117/", "num_games_owned": 195, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 21556, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2582, "last_played": 1786604895, "avatar": "ff01ebaee728d868320e4468a902c1ef9dd52148"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "[h2] Say「Thanks」to helldivers,luv ya all.[/h2]\n\n     刚出的时候朋友送的，浅玩20h被朋友带到n8，PVE的游戏玩得少，就退坑了。前几天另一个朋友说想一起玩，遂重载，复健。\n     \n     这几天买了第一个债券，武器装配组合很有趣ദ്ദി，打虫子爆浆真的很解压，结算时的满身绿色酸液和红色鲜血，飘荡的残破披风，庄严地敬礼，很有成就感。\n\n     路人大多都很友好，积极交流活跃气氛，虽然我不开麦，只偶尔打字。喜欢这种氛围。并且感觉偶尔匹到一起奋斗挣扎仍然任务失败的对局比被大佬带飞更有意思。当然，我并不想被虫子吃...(ᇂ_ᇂ|||)\n     \n     最近他忙，遂野排，尽管野排，也很上头。要是能多几个固玩一起玩相必体验会更有滋味吧_(:зゝ∠)_", "timestamp_created": 1740777169, "timestamp_updated": 1740777236, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188986851", "author": {"steamid": "76561199509936362", "personaname": "Dullahan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199509936362/", "num_games_owned": 26, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 87663, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1901, "playtime_at_review": 78549, "last_played": 1788052367, "avatar": "91506f4ff9c783487bbdd8fab27be3f3c26c5916"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "有相当的敌人设计的都很好，VOX走机制干爆一台的成就感很强，然后转头一看——左边四台右边两台\n好设计，但被逆天堆怪毁了，坏箭头", "timestamp_created": 1740773376, "t